# Solo Graffiti (run graffiti; data run.graffiti, here 16 s): the classic games' tag mode alone. A combo's grind
# lines and gaps are tagged when it banks. The low ledge's BS 50-50 (park grind line 11, 475) tags it;
# again with a manual on after (BS 50-50 + Manual, 1356, your own best beaten) it is re-tagged, a
# tagged event from yourself, still one obstacle. The flat rail's FS Boardslide (382) tags line 28. The
# clock runs out: graffitiOver with one count, 2.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
cmd 0 setData run.graffiti.seconds 16
cmd 0 run graffiti
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
bot balance
cmd 600 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 606..700
hold ollie 690..705
tap grind 776
tap up 1052
tap down 1057
hold ollie 1170..1180
cmd 1300 teleport -7 1.4 0.14 0
hold up 1306..1380
hold ollie 1370..1390
tap grind 1428
run 2000
expect event graffitiStart{seconds=16} within 1..1
expect event tagged{player=1,obstacle=line:11,points=475,from=0} within 467..467
expect session.owned == 1 at 500
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + Manual,points=1356} within 1282..1282
expect event tagged{player=1,obstacle=line:11,points=1356,from=1} within 1282..1282
expect session.owned == 1 at 1290
expect event tagged{player=1,obstacle=line:28,points=382,from=0} within 1660..1660
expect event tagged count == 3
expect event graffitiOver{counts=2} within 1920..1920
expect session.owned == 2 at end
expect session.mode == over at end
expect no event bail
